  {
    "id": "mock_uuid",
    "type": "section",
    "title": "Executive Summary",
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "mock_uuid",
        "type": "instruction",
        "content": "Provide a concise overview of the audit, highlighting the total number of differences found and the overall impact on compliance, quality, or risk."
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "mock_uuid",
    "type": "section",
    "title": "Methodology",
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "mock_uuid",
        "type": "instruction",
        "content": "Describe the approach used to compare the documents (e.g., side‑by‑side diff, keyword analysis, version control), any tools employed, and the criteria for classifying issues (severity, priority)."
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "mock_uuid",
    "type": "section",
    "title": "Findings – Differences Identified",
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "mock_uuid",
        "type": "instruction",
        "content": "Compare the supplied documents and produce a JSON object with an `items` array. Each item must contain the following fields: - `issue_id` (unique identifier) - `description` (brief summary of the difference) - `location_doc_a` (section/page/paragraph in Document A) - `location_doc_b` (section/page/paragraph in Document B) - `diff_detail` (exact textual or structural difference) - `severity` (Low, Medium, High, Critical) - `suggested_improvement` (actionable recommendation to resolve the issue) Return the JSON in the format: `{ \"items\": [ { ... }, { ... } ] }`.",
        "assignTo": "diff_data"
      },
      {
        "id": "mock_uuid",
        "type": "text",
        "content": "<!-- IF: diff_data -->  \r"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "mock_uuid",
    "type": "section",
    "title": "Summary Table of All Differences",
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "mock_uuid",
        "type": "text",
        "content": "| Issue ID | Description | Location (Doc A) | Location (Doc B) | Severity |\r"
      },
      {
        "id": "mock_uuid",
        "type": "text",
        "content": "|----------|-------------|------------------|------------------|----------|\r"
      },
      {
        "id": "mock_uuid",
        "type": "text",
        "content": "<!-- BEGIN LOOP: diff_data.items -->\r"
      },
      {
        "id": "mock_uuid",
        "type": "text",
        "content": "| {{ loop_item.issue_id }} | {{ loop_item.description }} | {{ loop_item.location_doc_a }} | {{ loop_item.location_doc_b }} | {{ loop_item.severity }} |\r"
